@startuml
title Concurrency - AsyncTaskStatus Full State
hide empty description
[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> SUBMITTED : accepted for submission
SUBMITTED --> RUNNING : worker/caller thread starts
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : executor rejects
SUBMITTED --> TIMEOUT : queue/result timeout wins before run
SUBMITTED --> CANCELLED : cancel
RUNNING --> SUCCESS : task returns
RUNNING --> FAILED : task throws
RUNNING --> TIMEOUT : result timeout wins
RUNNING --> CANCELLED : cancel
FAILED --> FALLBACK : fallback configured
REJECTED --> FALLBACK : fallback configured
TIMEOUT --> FALLBACK : fallback configured
FALLBACK --> FALLBACK_SUCCESS : fallback returns
FALLBACK --> FALLBACK_FAILED : fallback throws / executor rejects
SUCCESS --> [*]
FAILED --> [*] : no fallback
REJECTED --> [*] : no fallback
TIMEOUT --> [*] : no fallback
CANCELLED --> [*]
FALLBACK_SUCCESS --> [*]
FALLBACK_FAILED --> [*]
note right
状态名全部来自 AsyncTaskStatus。
FALLBACK 是过渡状态；
取消默认不进入 fallback。
end note
@enduml
